// New here: 406 margins & text size for every printed document · 407 black & white printing · 417 rename an account group
// AI switches — turn all AI off for a society, or one feature at a time · 494 faster first load (connections opened early)
// 495 background saves: entries are written to the device first and sent when the internet allows (Firebase offline queue) — shown in the help
