// v12.2 — SPEED (asked 8 Nov 2026)
// 6 long lists draw ~250 rows first and add the rest as you scroll (print, Excel, copy and search always use every row)
// 7 progress bars: imports, AI, long jobs (loading() in core.js, aiBusy() in ai.js)
// 8 last 3 opened societies stay ready in memory → switching back is instant
// 11 after any change, the next calculations are prepared while the computer is idle
// 10 ⚡ Speed check (Display & comfort) · 12 weekly clean-up of temporary data only (never accounts, members or entries)
// Calculation speed itself: per-member index in engine.js (results identical to the old full scan — tested A/B/C/D interest)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
